---
---
<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#6B6B6B]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z"/></svg>
        <span class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B] font-medium">Testimonials</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">
        Trusted by teams who get work done
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#6B6B6B] max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Reduce manual work, gain visibility, and help your team stay focused.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- TestMu AI -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-[#1A1A1A] flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><rect x="10" y="8" width="4" height="16" rx="2" fill="white"/><rect x="18" y="8" width="4" height="16" rx="2" fill="white"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-lg">TestMu AI</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
          "Eluu colleagues run daily briefings, track pipeline, and flag at-risk deals — all from Slack. What took 2 hours every morning now happens before we are online."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B]">Sales leadership and revenue teams</p>
      </div>

      <!-- LaCleo AI -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white text-xs font-bold">LC</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-lg">LaCleo AI</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
          "With Eluu colleagues, our team completes projects which took a week to complete in a couple of hours. We cannot go back to the old way of working anymore."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B]">Market Intelligence Agency</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Rippling -->
      <div class="bg-[#E8E3DA] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-yellow-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-black text-xs font-bold">R</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-lg tracking-wider uppercase text-sm">RIPPLING</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
          "We connected 4 tools and had an engineering colleague tracking PR velocity and sprint health. Setup took less than a day and we were up and running."
        </blockquote>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B6B6B]">Engineering leadership</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
